1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 4]

34
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,890
This is to leave no one alive
to testify.

35
00:01:44,020 --> 00:01:47,910
Lord Pei, I'll take the blood jade

36
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:49,290
and the thieves with me.

37
00:01:50,230 --> 00:01:50,560
Hold.

38
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:55,880
General Chen, the Blood Jade Mine
is in your care.

39
00:01:56,160 --> 00:01:58,710
Beyond it lies
the Fengyi Bureau's jurisdiction.

40
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:00,590
Under the laws of Yong,

41
00:02:00,590 --> 00:02:02,000
a general who leaves his post
without permission

42
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,310
shall be flogged.

43
00:02:03,770 --> 00:02:04,780
You wouldn't dare.

44
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:06,350
I am a General

45
00:02:06,350 --> 00:02:08,860
appointed by His Majesty
to guard the Blood Jade Mine.

46
00:02:09,110 --> 00:02:11,300
The blood jade was stolen.
I have to act.

47
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:12,590
Other than His Majesty,

48
00:02:13,470 --> 00:02:14,390
no one has the right

49
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,490
to interfere with me.

50
00:02:23,090 --> 00:02:26,000
Lord Pei, you stay out of my way,
and I'll stay out of yours.

51
00:02:26,450 --> 00:02:27,310
Back down now,

52
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:30,540
and we can still get along.

53
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:37,030
Long live His Majesty.

54
00:02:37,030 --> 00:02:38,080
Long live His Majesty.

55
00:02:38,640 --> 00:02:40,470
This blood-jade ruler was bestowed
by His Majesty.

56
00:02:40,470 --> 00:02:43,030
It punishes royals, officials,
and generals.

57
00:02:43,250 --> 00:02:44,690
Anyone who violates the laws of Yong

58
00:02:44,920 --> 00:02:46,080
may be disciplined with it

59
00:02:46,250 --> 00:02:47,280
without reporting to His Majesty.

60
00:02:48,780 --> 00:02:51,530
General Chen, next time,

61
00:02:52,370 --> 00:02:53,690
I will use it on you.

62
00:03:12,630 --> 00:03:13,070
Hurry.

63
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:14,690
Hurry.

64
00:03:15,310 --> 00:03:16,590
Zhao, get up.

65
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:19,040
Endure it until you can walk out.

66
00:03:19,260 --> 00:03:20,430
Find your birth parents,

67
00:03:20,620 --> 00:03:22,000
and you won't have to suffer anymore.

68
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:24,150
[Pei Qingrui, Pei Zhao's adoptive father]
Come on.

69
00:03:24,830 --> 00:03:25,250
Move!

70
00:03:36,420 --> 00:03:37,800
There's a new recruitment next month.

71
00:03:38,300 --> 00:03:39,680
I want to try out for the Fengyi Guard.

72
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:41,620
You can't.

73
00:03:42,530 --> 00:03:43,960
Every Fengyi Guard
has an exceptional skill.

74
00:03:44,490 --> 00:03:46,110
Ji Chang'an is an expert in kite-making,

75
00:03:46,300 --> 00:03:47,780
and his mechanical skills are unmatched.

76
00:03:48,450 --> 00:03:50,240
Xiao Ruoming is a master assassin.

77
00:03:50,340 --> 00:03:51,120
During the selection,

78
00:03:51,370 --> 00:03:53,060
he defeated 127 first-class

79
00:03:53,070 --> 00:03:53,940
Fengyi Guards by himself.

80
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:55,440
What about the written exam?

81
00:03:55,840 --> 00:03:57,400
Didn't Lu Li get in through that?

82
00:03:57,660 --> 00:03:58,910
I could try incense making.

83
00:04:01,380 --> 00:04:02,400
You still can't.

84
00:04:03,270 --> 00:04:04,910
The Fengyi Guard's never admitted women.

85
00:04:09,350 --> 00:04:10,810
Sir, we're at Spice Street.

86
00:04:17,280 --> 00:04:19,120
Your Highness, that's the woman.

87
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:21,560
[Wei Lin, Crown Prince's Guard]
I heard from the Fengyi Bureau

88
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:23,360
that Pei Zhao took one look at her,

89
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,310
so delicate and lovely,

90
00:04:25,310 --> 00:04:26,340
and couldn't take his eyes off her.

91
00:04:27,180 --> 00:04:31,390
If Pei Zhao knew the Fengyi Guard
was saying that,

92
00:04:31,390 --> 00:04:33,000
he'd be furious.

93
00:04:33,340 --> 00:04:34,270
He's not that foolish.

94
00:04:34,650 --> 00:04:36,430
Bringing a woman back from the mountains

95
00:04:36,430 --> 00:04:38,600
and keeping her by his side?

96
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:40,540
You mean

97
00:04:41,320 --> 00:04:42,190
he's putting on an act?

98
00:04:43,870 --> 00:04:45,350
I'll go test him myself.

99
00:04:52,110 --> 00:04:53,240
Welcome, honored guests.

100
00:04:55,070 --> 00:04:55,700
Feel free to look around.

101
00:05:31,190 --> 00:05:31,630
Sir.

102
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:32,360
There's more over here.

103
00:05:32,580 --> 00:05:33,080
Take a look.

104
00:05:38,670 --> 00:05:39,090
Sir.

105
00:05:48,020 --> 00:05:49,060
[Chawu Incense]

106
00:05:52,340 --> 00:05:53,180
[Chawu Incense]

107
00:05:55,740 --> 00:06:01,060
[Chawu Incense]

108
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:17,190
Surprised to find Chawu Incense here.

109
00:06:18,110 --> 00:06:20,400
They say it revives withered grass

110
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:21,530
and leave its scent even on stone.

111
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:23,690
You want this?

112
00:06:24,570 --> 00:06:25,140
No, I don't.

113
00:06:25,770 --> 00:06:26,360
Guard Xu.

114
00:06:30,180 --> 00:06:30,620
Coming.

115
00:06:30,670 --> 00:06:31,130
Sir.

116
00:06:34,570 --> 00:06:34,950
Sir.

117
00:06:38,460 --> 00:06:39,160
Smell this.

118
00:06:45,300 --> 00:06:46,010
What's going on?

119
00:06:48,910 --> 00:06:49,490
Honored guests.

120
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:51,740
This is our finest Sichuan pepper.

121
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:54,390
You won't find it anywhere
on this street.

122
00:06:58,550 --> 00:06:59,260
Not good enough.

123
00:07:02,510 --> 00:07:03,340
I want this quality.

124
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:07,520
I can afford it.

125
00:07:11,450 --> 00:07:13,120
You two certainly know your goods.

126
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:15,680
But let me make one thing clear.

127
00:07:15,980 --> 00:07:17,630
I can only introduce you to the seller.

128
00:07:17,900 --> 00:07:19,600
Whether you can buy it

129
00:07:19,950 --> 00:07:21,720
depends on your luck.

130
00:07:23,820 --> 00:07:24,220
Show us the way.

131
00:07:24,990 --> 00:07:25,340
Please.

132
00:07:37,430 --> 00:07:38,190
Take care.

133
00:07:47,070 --> 00:07:47,870
Take care.

134
00:07:55,030 --> 00:07:57,430
Why is Pei Zhao out with a woman?

135
00:07:57,790 --> 00:07:59,610
Has he lost his mind?

136
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,720
From the looks of it,

137
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:04,750
he really does seem taken with her.

138
00:08:05,240 --> 00:08:07,510
I wonder whether he's fallen for her

139
00:08:07,510 --> 00:08:08,730
or playing along.

140
00:08:09,570 --> 00:08:11,350
Send someone to inform Yun Qi.

141
00:08:12,110 --> 00:08:15,810
Tell him Pei Zhao and that woman
are on Spice Street.

142
00:08:16,870 --> 00:08:18,820
Why tell Yun Qi?

143
00:08:20,970 --> 00:08:22,550
The Noble Consort values Pei Zhao.

144
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:26,000
So, if I investigate well,

145
00:08:26,430 --> 00:08:27,870
Mother won't praise me.

146
00:08:28,560 --> 00:08:29,960
But if anything goes wrong,

147
00:08:30,630 --> 00:08:32,600
she'll blame me.

148
00:08:32,760 --> 00:08:33,910
Yun Qi is different.

149
00:08:34,490 --> 00:08:35,830
He's from Mother's family.

150
00:08:36,840 --> 00:08:38,100
Even if something goes wrong,

151
00:08:38,290 --> 00:08:39,720
I won't be blamed.

152
00:08:44,830 --> 00:08:47,970
♪Moonlight sways, flowers scent the air♪

153
00:08:48,110 --> 00:08:51,310
♪Who is singing softly in my heart?♪

154
00:08:51,700 --> 00:08:53,200
♪Your burning gaze♪

155
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,270
Enough.

156
00:08:54,270 --> 00:08:55,550
We're not here to shop.

157
00:08:58,500 --> 00:09:00,800
♪Fengyi blades lie hidden in the dark♪

158
00:09:00,810 --> 00:09:01,520
Sir.

159
00:09:02,030 --> 00:09:03,780
Aren't we here to buy Sichuan pepper?

160
00:09:04,210 --> 00:09:05,720
Why so sneaky?

161
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:07,710
Just like blood jade,

162
00:09:08,260 --> 00:09:09,200
the finest spices

163
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:11,150
are reserved for Phoenix Blood
and Qingluan nobility.

164
00:09:11,220 --> 00:09:12,290
They're off-limits to commoners.

165
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:15,220
Buying or selling them illegally
means death.

166
00:09:15,830 --> 00:09:16,970
They're just things.

167
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:18,530
Why rank people over them?

168
00:09:20,020 --> 00:09:21,330
Since Yong was founded,

169
00:09:21,630 --> 00:09:23,320
the Phoenix-Blooded imperial family
has stood above all,

170
00:09:23,320 --> 00:09:24,760
followed by the Qingluan clans.

171
00:09:25,960 --> 00:09:30,630
What about the Wingless
you mentioned before?

172
00:09:30,630 --> 00:09:31,600
Who are they?

173
00:09:33,150 --> 00:09:35,950
♪Ripple in your eyes♪

174
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:37,360
Each inch of jade costs blood.

175
00:09:37,790 --> 00:09:38,920
The Wingless pay the price.

176
00:09:39,550 --> 00:09:40,920
They're the lowest class of slaves.

177
00:09:41,730 --> 00:09:42,370
Slaves?

178
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,900
So were the Tianxuan villagers?

179
00:09:46,180 --> 00:09:46,590
Yes.

180
00:09:47,760 --> 00:09:48,790
But we're all human.

181
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:50,570
Why should...

182
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:55,580
Sir.

183
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:56,940
I smell that Sichuan pepper.

184
00:10:06,750 --> 00:10:08,100
Whatever it takes,

185
00:10:08,110 --> 00:10:09,510
make sure you see her face.

186
00:10:09,510 --> 00:10:10,770
If she really is Yun Shao,

187
00:10:10,770 --> 00:10:11,570
bring her to me at once.

188
00:10:11,570 --> 00:10:12,030
- Yes.
- Yes.

189
00:10:12,030 --> 00:10:12,400
Go.

190
00:10:22,210 --> 00:10:23,150
Sir, watch out.

191
00:10:32,420 --> 00:10:33,380
Yun Shao is over there.

192
00:10:33,460 --> 00:10:34,180
Don't let her get away.

193
00:10:38,120 --> 00:10:39,670
You filthy girl, what are you doing?

194
00:10:40,190 --> 00:10:41,090
Behave!

195
00:11:49,080 --> 00:11:50,230
His eyes and arms

196
00:11:50,890 --> 00:11:51,840
are fine.

197
00:11:52,350 --> 00:11:53,790
He'll recover in a few days.

198
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:55,120
I'll prepare a prescription.

199
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,720
That's good. Thank you, physician.

200
00:11:56,790 --> 00:11:58,960
Wipe his eyes with clean water.

201
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:00,320
All right.

202
00:12:03,360 --> 00:12:04,510
You shouldn't have done that.

203
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:05,670
I can protect myself.

204
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:09,080
The Fengyi Guard

205
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:10,950
never abandons those in need.

206
00:12:12,870 --> 00:12:15,870
I'd heard the Fengyi Guard was ruthless,

207
00:12:15,870 --> 00:12:17,080
killing without mercy.

208
00:12:17,660 --> 00:12:18,630
Turns out I was wrong.

209
00:12:19,360 --> 00:12:20,360
You're a good man, sir.

210
00:12:20,450 --> 00:12:21,680
So are Chang'an and the others.

211
00:12:22,750 --> 00:12:24,960
When did you grow so close
to Ji Chang'an?

212
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:27,360
You praise the Fengyi Bureau,
then single him out for more praise.

213
00:12:27,870 --> 00:12:29,100
Chang'an is nice.

214
00:12:29,670 --> 00:12:31,270
He's honest, kind, and always smiling.

215
00:12:31,850 --> 00:12:32,640
He's like a younger brother to me.

216
00:12:33,120 --> 00:12:34,200
That's enough. Stop wiping.

217
00:12:34,870 --> 00:12:35,840
No.

218
00:12:37,300 --> 00:12:38,650
Your eyes are still red.

219
00:12:39,910 --> 00:12:40,280
Sir.

220
00:12:41,670 --> 00:12:42,210
Sir.

221
00:12:43,090 --> 00:12:44,030
How are your eyes?

222
00:12:44,320 --> 00:12:46,140
I brought a carriage
to take you back to the Bureau.

223
00:12:46,680 --> 00:12:47,370
Tomorrow,

224
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:48,800
have Chang'an get your medicine.

225
00:12:49,640 --> 00:12:50,680
I have somewhere to be.

226
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:52,350
Where?

227
00:12:55,550 --> 00:12:56,960
Last night, I received a secret report.

228
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:59,240
Pei Zhao took a woman to Spice Street.

229
00:12:59,600 --> 00:13:00,910
I sent men to investigate,

230
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:03,000
but she killed one of my attendants.

231
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:03,700
She killed him?

232
00:13:04,040 --> 00:13:04,840
She dared kill someone?

233
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:06,600
That can't be Yun Shao.

234
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:11,360
But the servant who returned
said she looked a lot like her.

235
00:13:13,790 --> 00:13:14,710
Don't worry.

236
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:16,720
I'll go see her myself.

237
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:17,800
All right.

238
00:13:18,260 --> 00:13:19,360
I'll leave it to you.

239
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:37,000
Didn't you say not to come find you?

240
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:38,040
Why did you call me here?

241
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,320
Lord Pei's assassination.

242
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,750
Were you involved?

243
00:13:42,170 --> 00:13:44,030
You'd question me over an outsider?

244
00:13:44,720 --> 00:13:45,670
Were you involved or not?

245
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:46,320
No.

246
00:13:47,020 --> 00:13:47,670
I told you.

247
00:13:48,240 --> 00:13:49,960
I only want the Crown Prince dead.

248
00:13:50,550 --> 00:13:51,340
I see.

249
00:13:52,950 --> 00:13:54,120
You're leaving just like that?

250
00:13:56,720 --> 00:13:57,750
I have intel for you.

251
00:14:02,910 --> 00:14:04,790
This is about your Lord Pei.

252
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:05,710
Take a good look.

253
00:14:22,710 --> 00:14:24,000
This is absurd.

254
00:14:25,470 --> 00:14:26,940
Why did I buy something like this?

255
00:14:32,840 --> 00:14:33,200
Sir.

256
00:14:35,440 --> 00:14:36,390
Yesterday at the spice shop,

257
00:14:36,660 --> 00:14:37,520
Gu Qingyan was there too.

258
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:38,480
And he

259
00:14:39,830 --> 00:14:41,000
met with Lady Xu.

260
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:51,560
You wielded the blade.

261
00:14:53,410 --> 00:14:54,630
You pay with your life first.

262
00:15:04,340 --> 00:15:08,300
[Grave of Yun Xiang, My Late Sister]

263
00:15:09,390 --> 00:15:10,030
Yun Xiang.

264
00:15:11,550 --> 00:15:12,840
I've avenged you.

265
00:15:13,890 --> 00:15:15,200
He was only the first,

266
00:15:17,050 --> 00:15:19,040
but everyone who hurt you

267
00:15:20,080 --> 00:15:21,150
will pay in blood.

268
00:15:22,390 --> 00:15:23,080
Yun Xiang.

269
00:15:29,320 --> 00:15:30,200
Let's get you cleaned up.

270
00:15:32,080 --> 00:15:33,790
Then we'll go home.

271
00:15:36,070 --> 00:15:37,250
Didn't you say

272
00:15:38,600 --> 00:15:39,490
your hometown

273
00:15:39,840 --> 00:15:41,540
was covered in flowers?

274
00:15:42,160 --> 00:15:43,120
We'll go pick flowers

275
00:15:43,350 --> 00:15:45,330
and make lots
of beautiful incense beads.

276
00:15:48,980 --> 00:15:50,120
Everyone loves

277
00:15:50,130 --> 00:15:51,200
the incense beads you make.

278
00:15:51,390 --> 00:15:52,360
They all fight over them.

279
00:15:52,750 --> 00:15:53,910
My lady, you're the smartest

280
00:15:53,910 --> 00:15:55,830
and most amazing woman in the world.

281
00:15:58,080 --> 00:15:58,730
My lady.

282
00:16:02,030 --> 00:16:02,840
Yun Xiang.

283
00:16:04,520 --> 00:16:05,090
Yun Xiang.

284
00:16:09,320 --> 00:16:10,170
My lady, look.

285
00:16:11,030 --> 00:16:12,480
This is the new dress you bought me.

286
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,270
So pretty.

287
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,670
You're amazing, my lady.

288
00:16:19,150 --> 00:16:20,550
You've even learned archery.

289
00:16:21,390 --> 00:16:24,320
You're the most amazing person
in the whole world.

290
00:16:24,650 --> 00:16:25,120
No.

291
00:16:26,110 --> 00:16:26,860
I'm not.

292
00:16:27,190 --> 00:16:28,840
I couldn't protect you.

293
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:30,270
I'm sorry.

294
00:16:31,220 --> 00:16:33,480
My lady, the wicked chose to do evil.

295
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:35,510
Why should you blame yourself?

296
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:38,510
You're so gifted.

297
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:41,790
Leave the Yun family.
You'll be better off.

298
00:16:42,640 --> 00:16:44,270
But I don't have you anymore, Yun Xiang.

299
00:16:45,540 --> 00:16:47,100
Stay a little longer, please.

300
00:16:47,110 --> 00:16:47,840
Don't leave me.

301
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:50,740
It's all right.

302
00:16:51,990 --> 00:16:52,680
Keep walking.

303
00:16:53,870 --> 00:16:54,570
Don't look back.

304
00:16:57,320 --> 00:16:58,120
Don't go.

305
00:16:58,850 --> 00:16:59,440
Yun Xiang.

306
00:17:07,440 --> 00:17:08,910
Yun Xiang?

307
00:17:21,870 --> 00:17:22,940
Sir, we found something.

308
00:17:24,230 --> 00:17:26,350
The premium Sichuan pepper
scattered where the villagers died

309
00:17:26,490 --> 00:17:28,190
was transported
by Longsheng Escort Agency.

310
00:17:29,220 --> 00:17:30,240
Longsheng Escort Agency

311
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:32,110
claims to transport Sichuan pepper,

312
00:17:32,560 --> 00:17:34,760
but it's actually smuggling blood jade.

313
00:17:35,270 --> 00:17:36,400
The peddler who died that night

314
00:17:36,790 --> 00:17:37,630
was one of their informants.

315
00:17:38,870 --> 00:17:41,070
Is the agency connected to the rebels?

316
00:17:42,420 --> 00:17:43,170
Just as you suspected, sir.

317
00:17:44,310 --> 00:17:45,280
Longsheng Escort Agency

318
00:17:46,020 --> 00:17:47,820
is the rebels' base in the capital.

319
00:17:49,200 --> 00:17:50,070
Chen Daohua

320
00:17:50,070 --> 00:17:51,350
colluded with the rebels
to smuggle blood jade,

321
00:17:51,350 --> 00:17:52,400
then framed the Wingless.

322
00:17:53,920 --> 00:17:55,350
They've handed the Fengyi Bureau

323
00:17:55,350 --> 00:17:56,580
the perfect chance to take them down.

324
00:17:59,180 --> 00:17:59,760
Good.

325
00:18:00,510 --> 00:18:02,970
Then let's give them what they want.

326
00:18:23,720 --> 00:18:24,450
Zhao.

327
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:29,810
You must be tired
from the investigation.

328
00:18:30,310 --> 00:18:32,510
The Noble Consort gave me some pastries.

329
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:34,080
Since I've run into you,

330
00:18:34,550 --> 00:18:35,760
you should try some too.

331
00:18:36,290 --> 00:18:37,550
We're not that close.

332
00:18:37,800 --> 00:18:38,290
Lady Yun.

333
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:39,270
Please step aside.

334
00:18:41,220 --> 00:18:42,750
It won't delay your work.

335
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:44,680
Why not

336
00:18:44,680 --> 00:18:46,550
share them with your men here?

337
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:56,030
I haven't seen you before.

338
00:18:59,420 --> 00:19:00,270
You should try some too.

339
00:19:03,460 --> 00:19:04,870
She really is testing me.

340
00:19:05,160 --> 00:19:07,370
I must keep calm and reveal nothing.

341
00:19:08,270 --> 00:19:08,770
Lady Yun.

342
00:19:09,550 --> 00:19:10,510
Without my permission,

343
00:19:10,510 --> 00:19:11,860
no one here will touch your food.

344
00:19:12,320 --> 00:19:12,860
Please leave.

345
00:19:20,520 --> 00:19:20,900
Let's go.

346
00:19:33,700 --> 00:19:35,010
Go tell my brother

347
00:19:35,350 --> 00:19:36,930
she can smell wild peony nectar.

348
00:19:37,510 --> 00:19:38,510
It can't be her.

349
00:19:39,530 --> 00:19:40,350
Even so,

350
00:19:40,550 --> 00:19:42,180
how dare she set her sights on Lord Pei?

351
00:19:42,180 --> 00:19:42,900
She deserves to die.

352
00:19:43,070 --> 00:19:43,880
Slap yourself.

353
00:19:44,120 --> 00:19:44,890
Please calm down, my lady.

354
00:19:45,070 --> 00:19:46,590
You're just a maid.

355
00:19:46,590 --> 00:19:48,110
How dare you gossip about your masters?

356
00:20:01,470 --> 00:20:04,280
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

357
00:20:05,900 --> 00:20:09,090
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

358
00:20:10,410 --> 00:20:12,150
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

359
00:20:12,650 --> 00:20:17,090
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

360
00:20:19,250 --> 00:20:21,920
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

361
00:20:23,140 --> 00:20:28,150
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

362
00:20:28,470 --> 00:20:36,500
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

363
00:20:36,770 --> 00:20:45,390
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

364
00:20:45,390 --> 00:20:54,060
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

365
00:20:54,440 --> 00:21:03,310
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

366
00:21:03,740 --> 00:21:12,230
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
